Version: 0.6.0
Release: 1.2
Summary: Single binary providing simplified versions of system commands
Group: Base/Utilities
License: BSD-2.0
URL: http://www.landley.net/toybox/
Source: %{name}-%{version}.tar.bz2
Source1: config
Source4: usrbin.links
